# The live app (the lysterfield-lake Worker, wrangler.jsonc), built with
# `vite build` by `deploy`. Its videos come from the
# lysterfield-lake-dreams R2 bucket, through its custom domain (cached
# at Cloudflare's edge; the bucket's r2.dev URL is rate-limited and
# uncached, so it's only for testing).
VITE_APP_DREAMS=https://dreams.lysterfieldlake.com
VITE_APP_URL=https://lysterfieldlake.com
# Visitors' polaroids (plans/in-progress/polaroids.md): off until they ship.
VITE_APP_POLAROIDS=false
